India's real GDP growth went from **-5.8%** in FY21 (the Covid year) to a rebound of **9.7%** in FY22, then **7.6%**, **9.2%** and **6.5%** in FY25. These are the latest official figures I know, and they get revised often. I don't have a firm number for FY26, so I left it out.

